"price/>`__ or `ODROID U3 <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-u3/>`__ "
"(*Discontinued*))"
msgstr ""
"ODROID 开发板（`ODROID-C1+ "
"<https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-c1/>`__、`ORDOID-XU4 "
"<https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-xu4-special-price/>`__ 或 `ODROID U3 "
"<https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-u3/>`__（*已停产*））"

