msgstr "以下可选配件也可能有用："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:38
#: ea5475a4d05e471c9a43ecfe001858de
msgid ""
"`Logitech HD Pro Webcam C920 <http://www.logitech.com/en-us/product/hd-pro-"
"webcam-c920>`__ is the recommended camera for image processing applications "
"because it natively encodes images using the h264 format."
msgstr ""
"`罗技 HD Pro 网络摄像头 C920 <http://www.logitech.com/en-us/product/hd-pro-"
"webcam-c920>`__ 是图像处理应用的推荐摄像头，因为它原生使用 h264 格式编码图像。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:44
#: a3da35b87dd2491c8515016eddd8b54e
msgid ""
"The usable resolution of this webcam is limited to 640 x 480 (or perhaps "
"1280 x 720) because no official Linux driver has been written for this "
"camera yet."
msgstr "该网络摄像头的可用分辨率限制为 640 x 480（或 1280 x 720），因为目前尚未为该摄像头编写官方 Linux 驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:48
#: ab371fa3a155484996e398c5d6bba29b
msgid ""
"Protective Case for `XU4 <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-xu4-case-"
"black/>`__ or `C1+ <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-c2-c1-case-"
"black/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`XU4 <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-xu4-case-black/>`__ 或 `C1+ "
"<https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/odroid-c2-c1-case-black/>`__ 保护壳"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:49
#: 091eb118cda44a489424646979e9886c
msgid ""
"`HDMI Type-A cable <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/hdmi-1-4-cable-type-"
"a-a/>`__ in case you wish to connect the ODroid to a computer monitor"
msgstr ""
"`HDMI Type-A 线缆 <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/hdmi-1-4-cable-type-"
"a-a/>`__（如需将 ODroid 连接到显示器）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:51
#: ea5dd2cdc1114e8facabdefa9fb99eb2
msgid ""
"`Wifi module <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/wifi-module-3/>`__ if you wish"
" to connect to the ODroid from your desktop computer using WiFi"
msgstr ""
"`Wifi 模块 <https://www.hardkernel.com/shop/wifi-module-3/>`__（如需通过 WiFi "
"从桌面计算机连接到 ODroid）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:54
