#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:60
#: c6a7d2ba36264831adcb9aba203b187d
msgid "Initial ODROID Setup"
msgstr "ODROID 初始设置"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:62
#: b14a9a3e1972473b973074edfd6bd754
msgid ""
"It is easier to manage the odroid after it has a connection to your network."
"  We've used the following steps to complete the initial setup of the board:"
msgstr "将 ODroid 连接到网络后更易于管理。我们使用以下步骤完成开发板的初始设置："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:67
#: b33cb44916fc47b8a64aa85e2ddc77da
msgid "Discovering IP Address"
msgstr "发现 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:70
#: 8e542bc2b4104c338f1214242fc93751
msgid "Using Keyboard/Mouse/Monitor"
msgstr "使用键盘/鼠标/显示器"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:72
#: 0cc8353fc3cd49388521fd55634b58ea
msgid "Plug the preloaded eMMC or MicroSD card into the board"
msgstr "将预装系统的 eMMC 或 MicroSD 卡插入开发板"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:73
#: 9a333a9698f24ffa89f7c1a9540a2a0f
msgid "(Temporarily) attach a mouse and keyboard to the USB ports"
msgstr "（临时）将鼠标和键盘连接到 USB 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:74
#: a369f55cb7bf44ad86e5a233cdf45055
msgid ""
"Plug power into the board (at this point the boot LED should light up blue)"
msgstr "接通开发板电源（此时启动 LED 应亮起蓝色）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:76
#: 694b0d18f1d34fec81edbe73162a08a8
msgid ""
"Attach micro-HDMI cable to the board (this must be done \\ *after* the board"
" starts to boot, or the monitor may backpower the board / keeping it from "
"booting)"
msgstr "将 micro-HDMI 线缆连接到开发板（此操作必须在开发板开始启动*之后*进行，否则显示器可能会反向供电/阻止开发板启动）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:79
#: e3a8f14d5fc44b47b1005627d6825d98
msgid "A text menu will appear"
msgstr "将出现文字菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:81
#: ed25f0cf47fe4def80f818f1ad47355f
msgid "Choose advanced settings and enable the SSH server"
msgstr "选择高级设置并启用 SSH 服务器"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:82
#: 6c4f53eb489740d59379710175bde969
msgid "Choose the option to expand the root filesystem to fill the card"
msgstr "选择将根文件系统扩展至填满存储卡的选项"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:83
#: cc46ab43d8374cfab87351f4afb91e0d
msgid "Select save and reboot"
msgstr "选择保存并重启"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:85
#: 9ee39e6d584c4539b78c87352b73da2a
msgid "The board will reboot into a fairly standard looking Ubuntu"
msgstr "开发板将重启进入外观相当标准的 Ubuntu 系统"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:86
#: 5b77b90364a049ab8397163fe20eff23
msgid ""
"Go to the network setup icon in the upper right and join your wifi network"
msgstr "点击右上角的网络设置图标，加入 WiFi 网络"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:88
#: 99ac4f5f806f40a8b0f4e55d8034a729
msgid "Type \"ifconfig\" to see the IP address your board was assigned"
msgstr "输入「ifconfig」查看开发板被分配的 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:91
#: 2d7eb62972a24f86acf8002ccd7b96f1
msgid "Using command line"
msgstr "使用命令行"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:93
#: 28009654ed034d45a6488ec4220661d9
msgid ""
"You can discover the ip address of devices on your network using a utility "
"called nmap"
msgstr "您可以使用 nmap 工具发现网络中设备的 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:100
#: 2668a8449e3f4973a4a049015613784c
msgid ""
"This will return a list of discovered devices on your network for and you "
"will see an entry like"
msgstr "这将返回您网络中发现的设备列表，您将看到类似以下的条目："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:103
#: c2e136db2224433eab7f11efbec127f7
msgid "\\*(this example is RPi - will update to ODROID)"
msgstr "\\*（此示例为 RPi，将更新为 ODROID）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:112
#: 1ea6a05f51d6412bac451f752186356a
msgid "Common Setup with known IP Address"
msgstr "已知 IP 地址的通用设置"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:114
#: e454460df3cc4db98a9a8d1282c56b27
msgid ""
"From some other computer type \"ssh -Y odroid@IPADDRESS\" with password "
"odroid.  Confirm you can login and get a ssh shell"
msgstr "从其他计算机输入「ssh -Y odroid@IPADDRESS」，密码为 odroid。确认可以登录并获取 SSH shell。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:116
#: b520cadb5bae43449e4a32ffaefd75bf
msgid ""
"At an odroid shell type \"sudo adduser odroid dialout\" - this gives the "
"odroid account access to the serial (pixhawk) port."
msgstr ""
"在 odroid shell 中输入「sudo adduser odroid dialout」——这将赋予 odroid "
"账户访问串口（Pixhawk）的权限。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:118
#: 0f27eddaa9074d21ad096cb96a69cc48
msgid ""
"At an odroid shell type \"sudo adduser odroid plugdev\" - this gives the "
"odroid account access to the USB camera."
msgstr ""
"在 odroid shell 中输入「sudo adduser odroid plugdev」——这将赋予 odroid 账户访问 USB "
"摄像头的权限。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:120
#: 2f09690613d44539b99c793ad92e4f29
msgid ""
"Now you can unplug the keyboard/mouse/hdmi cables and just use ssh if you "
"want.  As long as you use the -Y option with SSH you can even run graphical "
"applications on the odroid and they will appear on your desktop computer "
"(assuming you are running something that understands X-Windows)"
msgstr ""
"现在您可以拔掉键盘/鼠标/HDMI 线缆，直接使用 SSH 连接。只要使用 SSH 的 -Y 选项，您甚至可以在 ODroid "
"上运行图形应用程序，它们将显示在您的桌面计算机上（前提是您运行的系统支持 X-Windows）。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:127
#: 671f2eee801240639213304d81d02e5b
