#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:230
#: 608659bdabe84f88ac5e9716c3582db9
msgid ""
"The Red Balloon Finder project was written to enable an Odroid to control an"
" Copter based quadcopter to hunt down and pop 1m red balloon for the "
"`Sparkfun 2014 AVC <https://avc.sparkfun.com/>`__.  The python code that "
"runs on the odroid can be found `here "
"<https://github.com/rmackay9/ardupilot-balloon-finder>`__.  The slightly "
"modified Copter-3.2 code can be found `here "
"<https://github.com/rmackay9/rmackay9-ardupilot/tree/avc4>`__. Installation "
"instructions are below."
msgstr ""
"红色气球查找器项目旨在使 ODroid 控制基于多旋翼的四轴飞行器，为 `Sparkfun 2014 AVC "
"<https://avc.sparkfun.com/>`__ 追踪并戳破 1 米红色气球。运行在 ODroid 上的 Python 代码可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/rmackay9/ardupilot-balloon-finder>`__ 找到。略微修改的 "
"Copter-3.2 代码可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/rmackay9/rmackay9-ardupilot/tree/avc4>`__ 找到。安装说明如下。"

